{
  "run_id": "PMC12028842__broad__pcd_D_o3mini__s2",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The starting material is untreated Ti-6Al-4V with a typical microstructure and baseline surface hardness.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is plasma nitriding Ti-6Al-4V at 500–600 °C for approximately 6 hours in a nitrogen–hydrogen atmosphere.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Precise control of atmosphere composition and nitriding time will prevent over-nitriding.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plasma nitriding will form a hard nitride surface layer on Ti-6Al-4V.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10890335::web::005::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The compound layer will contain TiN.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10890335::web::005::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The compound layer will contain Ti2N.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nitriding conditions will produce a nitride layer of controlled thickness.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At elevated temperature, nitrogen diffuses into the titanium matrix and reacts with titanium to form nitride compounds.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Formation of surface nitride phases increases surface hardness.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10890335::web::005::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nitride layer acts as a barrier against wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will leave the bulk mechanical properties largely unaffected.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Surface hardness will increase by approximately 50–100% relative to untreated Ti-6Al-4V.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10890335::web::005::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wear resistance will improve under sliding or abrasive wear at room temperature.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The improvement will remain predominantly at the surface while the underlying alloy retains its intrinsic ductility and toughness.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive nitriding or non-uniform nitride formation may compromise fatigue performance.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed effect is expected under ambient-temperature sliding wear conditions representative of structural service.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The exact hardness improvement and long-term fatigue performance may vary with minor deviations in processing conditions.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scale-up and treatment uniformity over large components may be variable.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
